# BADA 3 four-aircraft route integration and policy-isolation gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada3-route
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 ROUTE INTEGRATION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO B3RN uses REPORT with LNAV and VNAV enabled.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST INFO B3ON uses OFF with LNAV and VNAV enabled.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST INFO B3RF uses REPORT with LNAV and VNAV disabled.
00:00:00.20>ECHO TEST INFO B3OF uses OFF with LNAV and VNAV disabled.
00:00:00.25>ECHO TEST INFO Route constraints belong to BlueSky and envelope limits come from the active model.
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.45>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00

00:00:01.00>CRE B3RN,A320,41.160,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.10>CRE B3ON,A320,41.200,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.20>CRE B3RF,A320,41.240,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.30>CRE B3OF,A320,41.280,2.000,90,3000,180
00:00:01.40>DYNAMICS B3RN TEM
00:00:01.45>DYNAMICS B3ON TEM
00:00:01.50>DYNAMICS B3RF TEM
00:00:01.55>DYNAMICS B3OF TEM
00:00:01.60>BADACONFIG B3RN PYBADA
00:00:01.65>BADACONFIG B3ON PYBADA
00:00:01.70>BADACONFIG B3RF PYBADA
00:00:01.75>BADACONFIG B3OF PYBADA
00:00:01.78>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-route.csv
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPECHECKS B3RN LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.82>ENVELOPECHECKS B3RF LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.84>ENVELOPE B3RN REPORT
00:00:01.86>ENVELOPE B3ON OFF
00:00:01.88>ENVELOPE B3RF REPORT
00:00:01.90>ENVELOPE B3OF OFF

00:00:02.00>ADDWPT B3RN,41.160,2.240,4000,200
00:00:02.05>ADDWPT B3RN,41.340,2.240,6000,220
00:00:02.10>ADDWPT B3RN,41.340,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.15>ADDWPT B3RN,41.160,2.000,3000,170
