00:00:02.30>ADDWPT B3ON,41.380,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.35>ADDWPT B3ON,41.200,2.000,3000,170
00:00:02.40>ADDWPT B3RF,41.240,2.240,4000,200
00:00:02.45>ADDWPT B3RF,41.420,2.240,6000,220
00:00:02.50>ADDWPT B3RF,41.420,2.000,5000,190
00:00:02.55>ADDWPT B3RF,41.240,2.000,3000,170
00:00:02.60>ADDWPT B3OF,41.280,2.240,4000,200
