00:00:03.35>LNAV B3OF OFF
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT Navigation-on aircraft traverse all route sectors and capture constraints.
00:00:04.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT Navigation-off aircraft remain straight and level.
00:00:04.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT changes evidence only and not propagation relative to OFF.

